  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes when you upload a World certain tags just vanish. It seems to only affect the system tags and it happened to me 2 times. On an Avatar World it removed the Avatar World tag and more recently on another world with a different system tag. This does not happen every time you update though, only sometimes.\n\nCuriously it did retain the \"Won't Appear in New\" which is only given along with Avatar Worlds and Community Spotlight tags.\n\nI have been checking before and after every worldupdate i do and could finally pinpoint that it does in fact happen as the vrchat.com worldpage updates with the new file and such.\n\nThe support was very helpful when it happened and I know you guys are looking into this. Maybe more people with this issue can help you solve this so there is no manual intervention necessary anymore.",
